{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","蕾米雅"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名敏捷的游侠，在战斗中擅长寻找最强的敌人进行单挑。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我只是在打盹儿，马上就精神了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","状态大好，我的兴致提起来了"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","我的利爪，可不是摆设哦！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","要睡个大觉，补充体力啊……"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","无所事事才是人生的最高境界呀"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","瞧好了，今天就让你……见识绝技！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈，睡醒了，该活动筋骨咯！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","左，右，嚯！早上好呀！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嘿，看招！只是热身而已啦"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","舒舒服服醒来，开开心心收礼！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这是礼物吗？还不赖！"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","绿野旋风"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","野性之美与森林的原始力量。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","琥珀之野"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","让校园里充满阳光与野性！"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","喵唔——呀，伸个懒腰~"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","先小睡个……五小时~"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有没有金枪鱼呀？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","下雪了，好冷喵"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今晚要暖呼呼地睡觉喵"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一进来就热乎乎的喵！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今晚要去看烟花喵"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","蕾米雅是接替莱卡成为新任薄暮巡游者队长的人，实际年龄却比莱卡要大。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","蕾米雅天赋很高，但过于懒散，以至于很多人不清楚她的真正实力。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","蕾米雅不太喜欢绿裔的食物，她经常偷偷跑去圣石镇吃喝。这也是她此前反对封锁令的原因之一。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","蕾米雅对奶油制品和啤酒情有独钟，闻到这两者的味道便会从昏睡中苏醒过来。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","敌人见到蕾米雅时常常会放松警惕，结果就是被一记回旋踢击中。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","有传言称蕾米雅会在满月时分进行一种奇怪的仪式，以此来提升自己的体能。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","有目击者称蕾米雅会收集自己掉落的所有毛发，实际用途未知。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","蕾米雅不会明面上表现出对别人的好感，但她的尾巴会不自觉地挽上她喜欢的人。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","蕾米雅讨厌下雨，因为这会让她的毛毛湿哒哒的。所以她喜欢跟告雨一族做朋友。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","蕾米雅对于事情有自己的理解，当她进行传达工作时，总会不自觉地添油加醋。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","啊哈哈哈哈！毛线球！滚来滚去的毛线球！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415034.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅 & 达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","喵唔——呀，伸个懒腰~"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415110.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","有没有金枪鱼呀？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415111.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","下雪了，好冷喵"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415433.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","今晚要暖呼呼地睡觉喵"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415434.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","一进来就热乎乎的喵！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415607.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","今晚要去看烟花喵"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415608.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅"]]}